{"id":"wb-7-1905","name":"周家宅院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"周家宅院","text":"周家宅院，又称周家旧宅，位于中华人民共和国云南省蒙自市文澜街道武庙街15号，为民国时期当地富绅周子荫家族的四合院住宅，始建于1916年。宅院坐北朝南，共四进四院，为中西合璧式建筑。占地面积2809平方米，建筑面积3259平方米。2013年被公布为为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，2014年被辟为蒙自望云博物馆馆址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%85%E9%99%A2","revisionId":94116848,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94116848","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e50c9bc70833484640d5b78c.jpg","title":"周家宅院_-_正门_-_2025-10-28_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%91%A8%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%85%E9%99%A2_-_%E6%AD%A3%E9%97%A8_-_2025-10-28_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/%E5%91%A8%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%85%E9%99%A2_-_%E6%AD%A3%E9%97%A8_-_2025-10-28_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​周家宅院正门","width":320,"height":213}}